    "description": "<p>AURA SAVE UNLIVING-GHOUL</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 10</p>\n<p>The corruption clinging to your flesh becomes a choking grave-reek.</p>\n<p>You emanate a 10-foot stench aura. Living creatures beginning their turn in the aura or entering it must attempt a Fortitude save with the following results:</p>\n<p>Success the target is unaffected.</p>\n<p>Failure the creature is sickened 1.</p>\n<p>Fumble the creature is sickened 1 and slowed 1 for as long as it remains sickened.</p>\n<p>A creature that saves against your Ghast Stench is immune to your aura for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: a 10-foot aura; a living creature starting its turn in it or entering it rolls Fortitude against your Level DC — Failure sickened 1; Fumble sickened 1 and slowed 1 while sickened. A creature that saves is immune for 1 minute.</p>",
